      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of ectopic atrial rhythm with progressively increasing exit block is reported in a case of ischemic heart disease. Such a rhythm suggests significantly diseased atria which are unable to sustain a regular rhythm for a long period. This arrhythmia should warn the clinician of impending atrial arrest."},
